bold":true,"hover_event":{"action":"show_text","value":[{"text":"+3 Points."}]}}," These split into smaller pieces when broken."],["",{"text":"Mace","bold":true},{"text":"\n\nYour mace has 1.5+ blocks more range, faster attack speed, and Wind Burst I. It also "},{"text":"spam-click proof","bold":true,"hover_event":{"action":"show_text","value":[{"text":"It has a minimum attack charge, meaning that the attack cooldown needs to be charged at a certain amount before you can attack."}]}},{"text":".\n\nYou will be shown in the "},{"text":"actionbar","bold":true,"hover_event":{"action":"show_text","value":[{"text":"The text above your hotbar will show:\n"},{"text":"--== MACE SMASH READY ==--","color":"aqua"}]}}," when your wind burst is ready."],["",{"text":"Tips","bold":true},{"text":"\n\n- You can hit resources from below, and the wind burst will still work.\n\n- Breaking resources without wind burst still yields points.\n\n- You can hit other players..."}],["",{"text":"Other info","bold":true},{"text":"\n\n- You cannot take damage (Resistance V).\n\n- Fall damage is turned off.\n\n- You have extra jump strength (base 1.3)."}]]},custom_data={rulebook:true},custom_name={"italic":false,"text":"Rulebook"},tooltip_display={hidden_components:["written_book_content"]},item_model="knowledge_book"] 1